Subject: Calibration Lineage Separation Source

Description: Preservation of an operational provenance gap exposed when an unchanged regression corpus must measure a new additive runtime checkpoint.

& [SourceSnapshot] is immutable
  + [source_snapshot_uuid] is d1fbca98-eef7-4884-97f2-b23ac5026ad7
